      "evidence": "Windows tests514–545: POSITION FLOAT3 maps to XYZ2,POSITIONT FLOAT4 maps to XYZRHW4; other tested semantics/index1/empty map to0. Positive cases are todo_wine, not claims Wine implements them. Test notes native configuration may vary."
