      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/device.c",
      "evidence": "Converted FVF cache3563+ owns a separate object set from public CreateVertexDeclaration; GetFVF3657+ returns declaration-associated value. Cache origin must be independent of user association and detachable cache ownership."
