  "scope": "Stage4J10 covers two exact Windows POSITION-only user declaration associations and separate converted-cache origin. All other reverse mappings keep prior0; nonzero offset/stream/method/multiple-element guards are conservative policy, not new native HAL claims. Real SDK tests user-first/cache-first identity,128 collision pairs,269 queries and metadata rounds,recorded private lifetime,Capture/Apply and public cache Reset;9 declarations,133 inline FVFs,141 resource bindings,5 position-only UP draws and5 simulated transport replies. Both GPU backends independently verify320 pixels and zero guest maps before owner release. Full reverse FVF inference,D3D8,failed UP/stream hardware bounds,full Reset/loss/thread/format/MSAA/fullscreen/multibuffering/wrapper conversion,native HAL,games/FPS and overall stages4/5/6 remain open. Host/protocol/shader/bundle and D3D8/DDraw unchanged.",
